m5compat (this folder: m5compat.cpp, m5sound.cpp and include/) is available under the MIT License below,
as well as under Tabulous5's GPL-3.0-or-later. It is Tabulous5's stand-in for the M5Unified, Preferences and
LittleFS calls ported code makes under P4 Launcher, and other P4 Launcher apps (the Multitool's) build with it.

